          "text": "OpenClaude is also mirrored to GitLawb: gitlawb.com/node/repos/z6MkqDnb/openclaude Quick Start | Setup Guides | Providers | Development | VS Code Extension | Partners | Community - One CLI across cloud APIs and local model backends — no per-provider tooling - Guided provider setu",
