        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "npm install -g @gitlawb/openclaude@latest If you're on Arch Linux, you can install OpenClaude from the community-maintained AUR package: paru -S openclaude If the install later reports ripgrep not found, install ripgrep system-wide and confirm rg --version works in the same termi",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-03T08:04:18.951405+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "7c46e7c3145dc0d7a5493d7e65ea7e985979d974a71bf71016a38cb6757a03bc",
          "excerpt": "npm install -g @gitlawb/openclaude@latest If you're on Arch Linux, you can install OpenClaude from the community-maintained AUR package: paru -S openclaude If the install later reports ripgrep not found, install ripgrep system-wide and confirm rg --version works in the same termi",
