          "text": "Verify / troubleshoot installed version: openclaude --version npm view @gitlawb/openclaude dist-tags npm install -g @gitlawb/openclaude@latestopenclaude Inside OpenClaude: - run /provider for guided provider setup and saved profiles - run /onboard-github for GitHub Models onboard",
