          "excerpt": "Advertisement Trump calls Xi’s Washington visit ‘exciting’, but claims US leads China in AI race US president praises Xi and predicts they have ‘a lot of good things to discuss’ at summit, while bragging of beating Beijing in tech war 2-MIN READ2-MIN Listen Mark Magnierin New Yor",
