          "anchors": [
            "min"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "A lot of good things to discuss, very, very productive things to discuss with President Xi.” Analysts say expectations are relatively low for meaningful deliverables or significant structural reform coming out of the summit.",
